WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:04.450
Have you ever wondered what the inimitably
douchey Senior Technical Researcher David

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:06.240
Rosen wishes he could be doing?

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:11.690
Foundation Staff used SCP-978, the Desire
Camera, to snap a picture of Technical Researcher

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:16.160
Rosen while he was approving requisition forms
with a supervisor in the room.

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:17.260
This was the result:

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:19.980
"Sitting at his desk, eyes closed.

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:21.950
The window behind him is broken.

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:23.910
There is nobody else in the office."

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:28.370
Perhaps it would be prudent for Researcher
Rosen to be given a psych evaluation.

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:30.730
Just to make sure he's, you know, okay.

